OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 1970s murder of his
OL,4,Ascientist ex-wife dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man jailed for life for murdering his
OL,7,Fex-wife in Aberdeen in the 1970s has
OL,8,Fdied, the Scottish Prison Service (SPS)
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FChristopher Harrisson, 85, was found
OL,12,Fguilty of killing Brenda Page following
OL,13,Fa trial in 2023.
OL,15,FHe had denied murdering the 32-year-old
OL,16,Fgenetics expert in 1978, a year after
OL,17,Fthe couple were divorced.
OL,19,FSPS confirmed Harrisson, who was a
OL,20,Fprisoner at HMP Grampian, died on
OL,21,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
